cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite both the dataset (below) and the preferred-citation paper."
type: dataset
title: "SOMA AI Emission Factors (SAEF)"
abstract: "SOMA AI Emission Factors (SAEF) is a versioned dataset of estimated carbon and water factors for AI inference, per million tokens, by model class and by region, for Scope 3 Category 1 reporting under the GHG Protocol and CSRD. It covers 210 countries and economies, 27 US eGRID subregions and 143 AWS, Azure and Google Cloud regions."
